    <div class="left-column"></div>
    <div class="center-column">
      <h1>Michael Heilmann's Arcadia Engine</h1>
      <p>
      Arcadia Engine is the core engine abstraction module. It provides common
      event, input, audials, visuals, backend, backend-context, resource, and
      node interfaces used by engine implementations and higher-level engine
      layers.
      </p>

      <h2>Documentation</h2>
